Z||000006||AkursedX||07-17-2001||10:50 PM||||here's a link for you to another thread with your same basic question: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/002476.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/002476.html</A> <P>I think when you form a friendship with a girl, you have severely cut your chances of ever getting into a relationship with that person, because of the reason you just stated.  You are their security to fall back on.  I know it is a frustrating place to be in sometimes, but it's just the way things work out.  I would say not to push it, because then you could end up losing a friend.  And who knows, maybe one day she might see the light and go out with you.  But don't count on it.  <P>But no, you don't have to be a jerk to get a girl.  Just be yourself, and don't worry about getting a girl.  Just let things happen.  There are more important things to worry about than that.  Being single isn't really that bad.  You can do whatever you want, go out with whoever you want, and you have more money to be spending on your fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>Or you could always become gay  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  LOL<P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
